WEBVTT

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.820
2 Years Ago

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.490
I believe introductions are in order.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.470
I'm Ushirode Kiruka.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.890
My dream is to win Nationals
and become number one!

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.390
W-Win Nationals?

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.480
Become number one?

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.410
Oh, you won a local tournament?

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:28.130
Yeah.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.840
All right, do your best.
We expect great things.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.130
I will! Glad to be here!

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:36.260
Okay, next.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:37.730
Yes.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:40.900
I'm Oomune Mune.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.130
<b>Scorching</b>

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.130
<b>Ping Pong Girls</b>

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:16.780
<b>Fifth Serve</b>

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:16.780
<b>I Want to Feel My Heart Race With You</b>

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:30.260
Captain versus Agari, huh? It's been a while!

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:32.680
Who do you think will win, Hokuto?

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:33.810
I don't know.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:38.550
But the captain's skills are unreal today...

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.060
...meow.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.430
You like the ears, huh?

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.440
But, really, I wonder
which of them is better.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.770
It's gotta be Agari-senpai, right?

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.620
She's ranked number one, after all.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:54.150
But the captain hasn't lost
a single point yet.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.490
And she has to be
worn out as a result!

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:58.780
Agari-senpai has the upper hand here!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:01.650
Shh. The game's about to begin.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:10.000
Agari-chan.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.700
Just to confirm...

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.170
Hm? What is it?

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:20.050
If I beat you, I'll make it
onto the team play roster, right?

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.590
Yeah, that's right.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.410
You'd better not go back on your word later.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.680
I would never.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.640
Not that I would need to, anyway.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.440
Captain Kiruka versus Agari-senpai...

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.900
Love-all!

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:44.370
<i>I'm gonna make it
onto the team play roster for sure!</i>

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:47.330
<i>This is my first step toward Nationals!</i>

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.080
Go, Agari!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.570
<i>Nationals, huh?</i>

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.430
<i>It hadn't even crossed my mind.</i>

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:01.220
<i>I was having enough fun playing table tennis
with the person facing me.</i>

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.470
The captain brought out her chop!

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:15.060
<i>But... I get it now.</i>

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.950
<i>There'll be loads
of amazing players at Nationals,</i>

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.370
<i>and I'll be able to feel
my heart race even faster!</i>

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.900
She used a loop drive...

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:32.290
...to get it over the net?

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.280
The loop drive, a stroke
with an open racket angle,

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:37.130
is an effective counter for the chop.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.500
And Agari-chan owns that stroke.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.810
Not even the captain
can keep the loop down!

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.130
The ball jumped up! It's a chance!

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.830
A chance for a backhand winner!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:50.270
That's that, huh?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.190
Even with her time off,
Kiruka's still got it...

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:01.720
Her impregnable defense!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.360
Impregnable defense?

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.420
There's more to Kiruka than her chops.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.820
If anything, this is where she excels.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.540
As a chopper, her greatest weapon

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.610
is her wide range of defense!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:19.540
Like a wall, she returns
any and all kinds of strokes.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:25.050
<i>Wow. She doesn't have any openings.</i>

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.170
How boring.

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:32.710
If you can't break through a wall like me,

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.100
you'll never make it to Nationals!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.310
Nationals!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.560
Nationals!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.590
What awesome defense!

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:43.440
Agari-senpai's backhand smashes
aren't working at all!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.630
Well, Kiruka can take on
two table tennis robots at once, after all.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.240
Why are <i>you</i> boasting
about it, Munemune-senpai?

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.120
If this keeps up, Agari's gonna lose!

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:56.960
She has trouble smashing with her forehand.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:00.420
But if she can only use
the less-decisive backhand smash,

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.420
she'll never break through
the captain's defense!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.840
Whatever could you mean?

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.090
<i>She pivoted around?</i>

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:13.060
I don't have a weakness!

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:16.670
Agari hit a forehand smash!

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.620
<i>She really did have trouble
with that stroke.</i>

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:24.320
<i>In our first match,
she only got it right the one time.</i>

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.280
<i>She's hitting them
one after another!</i>

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:31.580
Koyori-chan, it was after she played you

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:34.810
that she started practicing her forehand.

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.420
Munemune-senpai.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.710
Could you help me
practice my forehand smash?

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.370
I want to become a better player!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.920
So I can be a worthy rival to Koyori!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.130
<i>She wants to be my rival?!</i>

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.100
<i>Agari-chan...</i>

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.310
<i>Agari-chan... Agari-chan...</i>

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.020
<i>Her forehand is way more
powerful than her back.</i>

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:04.310
<i>How she's grown!</i>

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:05.770
<i>Crap.</i>

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.940
<i>I got thrown off, and now
my forehand's wide open.</i>

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:10.700
Koyori!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.080
Keep your eyes peeled and watch me!

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:23.410
This is who I am!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.630
...who I am!

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.740
She scored!

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:44.690
We have our first team play member!

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:51.320
<i>It really does feel great
to score with a forehand smash.</i>

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.310
<i>And you're the one
who reminded me of that, Koyori.</i>

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.490
<i>But...</i>

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:59.700
<i>I won't be satisfied with you alone.</i>

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.210
<i>I...</i>

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:04.920
<i>I want to go higher, to the very top!</i>

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.390
Agari-senpai!

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.260
Agari-senpai!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.340
<i>I see now.</i>

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.890
<i>The reason Agari-chan's play
makes my heart race</i>

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:19.310
<i>is because she's seriously
aiming for Nationals.</i>

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.400
<i>Nationals...</i>

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.490
<i>Nationals!</i>

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:25.770
A-Agari-chan!

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:29.230
I want to go to Nationals, too!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:42.580
Nationals is where your heart
can race the most, right?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:46.670
Then I want to aim for that summit, too!

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:51.670
I want to feel my heart race
with you even more!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:03.220
Hmph! Save those words
for <i>after</i> you beat the captain!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.300
N-Not that it matters to me,

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:09.520
since I don't care about
feeling my heart race with you.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.350
But...

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:16.580
The only one you're allowed
to lose to is me.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.740
So you'd better win, no matter what!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.680
That got me good!

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:32.550
I wasn't expecting Agari
to hit any forehand smashes.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:37.880
Now, the last one up is
the transfer student, Koyori-chan, huh?

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:42.810
I can't wait to see
what kind of play you'll show me!

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.850
Let's have a good game!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.740
<i>Just like Munemune said,</i>

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.200
<i>she really seems to be enjoying herself.</i>

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:06.330
<i>Then...</i>

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.290
<i>How about this?</i>

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:11.570
There's Captain Kiruka's chop!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:12.920
There's so much backspin on it!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.710
That ball's gonna die!

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:17.170
<i>Koyori!</i>

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:18.590
<i>Koyori-chan!</i>

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.620
Koyori-senpai...

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:27.640
...returned it!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:38.100
Wow! The captain's returning everything, too.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:41.030
<i>Kiruka's chops aren't working.</i>

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.210
Whoa...

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.760
Koyori-chan's got the upper hand now.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.760
<i>It's just as Munemune said.</i>

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.310
<i>Why do you look like
you're having so much fun?</i>

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.600
My heart's racing!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.780
Is the captain <i>smiling</i>?

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.870
She is.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.320
<i>I'm starting to see now.</i>

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.790
<i>This girl's amazing, too!</i>

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.240
<i>I want to go.</i>

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:42.970
<i>No, I'm going!</i>

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:48.470
<i>No matter what,</i>

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.560
<i>I'm going to Nationals with Agari-chan!</i>

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:06.910
<i>Because I'm sure there are loads
of heart-racing moments waiting for me!</i>

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.290
Wow!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.910
Koyori-senpai won!

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:30.890
Oh, man, you got me good!

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:32.680
Captain?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:33.850
She broke?

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:38.840
Now, then.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.280
So, yeah.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.490
As a result of the twenty-prong face-off,

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:49.240
Agari and Koyori-chan have made it
onto the team play roster.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:50.900
Congrats.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:52.130
You did it!

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:53.920
Congratulations.

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.660
Th-Thank you.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.210
I-It's only natural!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.710
The four other members

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:03.610
will be picked based on these matches
and the school rankings.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:06.220
1. Kamiya Agari
2. Tsumujikaze Koyori
3. Tenka Hanabi
4. Itsumo Hokuto
5. Munemune

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.450
Look forward to the announcement.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.890
Right!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:11.140
Then, shall we start normal practice,
if a little later than usual?

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.640
No taking off the cat ears, of course.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:17.090
Meow!

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:28.770
I'm beat today.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.810
Why do you still have those on?

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:32.650
I forgot to give them back.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:36.040
Whoa! They suit you so well,
I didn't even notice!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.490
Why not just return them now?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.510
I'll do it tomorrow.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.960
I'd get in the way if I went back now.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.710
Senpai!

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.280
Good work today!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.250
Agari-senpai, Koyori-senpai,

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:52.220
your matches earlier were super awesome!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.920
You were so cool back there, Koyori-senpai!

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:57.980
Th-Thank you.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.690
We'll be off, then.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.140
Goodbye.

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:03.440
See you tomorrow!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.980
Take care on the way home!

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:06.900
We will.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.610
Oh, Hokuto-senpai!

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.910
Those look great on you!

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.980
Our first-years are so lively.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:16.580
Beam, beam.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.550
Good job hanging in there.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:30.390
Chopper or not,
taking on twenty took its toll, right?

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.050
Well, yeah.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:34.940
The last two, in particular.

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.850
They were so good!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.160
Yep.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:40.810
<b>1. Kamiya Agari
2. Tsumujikaze Koyori
3. Tenka Hanabi</b>

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.810
That's why I wanted you to meet them
as soon as possible.

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:44.690
I wanted you to know
how good they were,

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.490
and I wanted them to know
how good you were.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:51.910
How good I am? I lost, you know?

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:55.240
The captain's amazing.

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.690
I mean, isn't it obvious?

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:02.370
She played 18 people before me
and scored 5 points against each of them.

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:04.450
R-Right.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:07.780
Meanwhile, all we did
was score one point off her.

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:12.140
She was the one who suggested the rule,
but we can't be overjoyed just yet.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:14.990
Really? You seemed happy enough earlier.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:16.340
You even struck a victory pose.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:20.570
Th-That was because I made it
onto the team play roster!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:26.050
More crucially, the captain
hasn't shown her real skills yet.

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:28.690
If she ever does,

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:31.660
Koyori and I might not be able
to beat her even if we joined forces.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.140
What do you mean?

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.850
You'll find out eventually.

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:36.990
Eventually.

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:41.080
The captain is crazy good at doubles!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.530
Why would you spoil it for her?!

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:46.060
It's not really a secret, right?

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.460
Well, no...

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:50.630
White Panties wanted to say it herself.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.130
Don't call me White Panties!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.470
But you are White Panties, White Panties.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.190
No more, no less.

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:58.330
I have a name, and it's Agari!

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.330
<i>Doubles?</i>

00:15:58.330 --> 00:15:59.810
<i>With whom?</i>

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:04.230
You were still rusty, weren't you?

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:06.730
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.930
I was at my best.

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:10.210
Lies.

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:13.050
I've played with you for years.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.280
I can tell when you're off your game.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.250
A loss is a loss.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.450
But, if I were with you,

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.770
no matter who I was facing
or what shape I was in,

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.740
I would never lose.

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:33.840
You think too highly of me!

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.050
Well, then.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:44.690
I guess I've figured out
how good everyone is now.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:49.770
So what do you make of those two, Kiruka?

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.740
Yeah, let's see...

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:02.210
Agari's gotten much better than before.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:04.580
Though I think it's more
mental than physical.

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:10.660
And what surprised me most was that
she'd learned to hit forehand smashes.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:15.750
It all started when she played Koyori-chan.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:18.970
She's changed a lot since she
started seeing her as a rival.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:21.610
Koyori-chan, huh?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:25.890
She was smiling
the entire time she played.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:30.270
Strangely enough, watching her smile
gets your heart racing, too.

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:33.300
She's weird, but really good.

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:35.280
No doubt about that.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.660
<b>Winner</b>

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:49.410
Just like how Agari-chan
expanded her arsenal

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:52.050
by remembering the joy of table tennis,

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:57.320
I think Koyori-chan will get
better and better now that she has a goal.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.780
The two of them will compete
and make each other better.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.130
They're the best duo, really.

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:07.860
Yeah.

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:10.770
What's the matter?

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:11.670
Look.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.740
It's like a ping pong ball.

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:23.000
Your head really is filled with
nothing but table tennis, huh?

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:25.710
Agari-chan.

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:26.500
What?

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:30.630
Nationals will be teeming
with amazing players, right?

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:33.670
That's right.

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:37.220
I want to meet them.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.210
I want to go to Nationals.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.850
Forget wanting, we're <i>going</i>.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:45.310
And forget just meeting them,
you're <i>beating</i> them.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:48.770
With me.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.730
With Agari-chan...

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:01.660
<i>Yeah, it goes on and on.</i>

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:06.660
<i>There's a long way to go on this road.</i>

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.250
<i>The road to Nationals!</i>

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.500
<b>1. Kamiya Agari
2. Tsumujikaze Koyori
3. Ushirode Kiruka</b>

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.380
We stand a good chance
with these two on our team.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.220
Yeah.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.610
We can aim for Nationals this year!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:27.680
My dream is to win Nationals
and become number one!

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.300
Okay, next.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:37.610
Yes.

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.400
Me, too!

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:42.030
My goal is to win Nationals, too!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:52.710
Let's go to Nationals this time, for sure!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:53.740
Yeah!

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:58.630
Welcome back, Kiruka.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.130
I'm home, Munemune.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:11.410
1. Kamiya Agari
2. Tsumujikaze Koyori
3. Ushirode Kiruka
4. Tenka Hanabi
5. Itsumo Hokuto

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:09.630
Looks like the upcoming tournament
will be loads of fun.

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:04.820
Suzumegahara Municipal Junior High

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:10.030
So, yeah...

00:23:07.610 --> 00:23:10.030
<b>Match</b>

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:14.450
April 23, Practice Match

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:14.450
Let's practice hard
for the upcoming practice match.

00:23:14.840 --> 00:23:17.160
P-Practice match?

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:19.940
Yeah. Keep that in mind.

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:22.420
Which school are we facing?

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:26.050
Mozuyama Junior High.

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:28.530
Mozuyama?

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:29.580
Yeah.

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:33.180
They're a powerhouse
that went to Nationals last year.

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:35.130
Nationals...

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:39.400
Nationals.

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:43.860
<b>Practice Match</b>

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:42.210
Nationals!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:24:00.000
Preview

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:47.650
You can at least watch the store, right?

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:47.650
Are you looking down on me?

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:49.400
You look serious, but completely stiff!

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:50.400
Relax, relax.

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:51.860
You're worried about Koyori-chan, right?

00:23:51.210 --> 00:23:53.660
I slept with my belly exposed...

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:55.910
Will it make her happy?

00:23:55.170 --> 00:23:57.160
Thank you very much!
